#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:7
#: 8ea249514a614e98a0b90e35fe2293fe
msgid "This article covers general information related to magnetic interference."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:11
#: 62cf64139d794e02b083967abeb14d48
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:13
#: c4e3d2532c2040178278032881f02b89
msgid "Magnet Interference on a compass can have a serious impact on navigation on all vehicle types."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:16
#: 4da6f8db1544420b9dacf0713cb5e027
msgid "This article explains what hardware changes you can make to reduce magnetic interference on the compass, along with supporting theoretical discussion. Information on how to set-up your compass can be found on :ref:`Advanced Compass Setup <common-compass-setup-advanced>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:23
#: 80c2d1103d054ff492ff5a332f03d904
msgid "See also `Magnetic Declination <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magnetic_declination>`__ (wikipedia)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:27
#: a30c6a8cda0248848a66fa2317a862df
msgid "Hardware changes to reduce magnetic interference on the compass"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:29
#: a33645f377ab4e8ba173790e2def3fbf
msgid "The best way method is to use an :ref:`external compass <common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance>` or :ref:`GPS+Compass <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>` module mounted on a mast up and away from magnetic source of interference including the power distribution board (PDB)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:33
#: f11c1d93df7d48018a0bc34d3695b4d7
msgid "Keep the wires between the PDB, ESCs and battery as short as possible.  The wires from the ESCs to the motors are less important because they are AC and produce less interference."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:36
#: da6958b691de49d288a38d3910507214
msgid "Twist the wires between the PDB, ESC and battery and use grounded shielding where possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:38
#: e465880a12d84f5981a94612d486db83
msgid "Replace the PDB and ESCs with a 4-in-1 ESC because they tend to produce less interference probably because their wires are shorter and closer together and they also have an aluminum plate on top which may help reduce the interference."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-magnetic-interference.rst:42
#: 13fd677fe2c6440ca39548291589ca3b
msgid "Add aluminum shielding (even gutter tape) around the wires from the ESC to the motors may reduce the AC interference.  Aluminum will not help reduce the primary DC interference from the PDB, ESCs and the wires connecting them."
msgstr ""

